# app-ads-admin — runtime config for the internal dashboard + /admin-api/* reverse proxy.
# Copy to admin.env on the VM and fill in. All values are CONFIG, not secrets (the admin
# container holds ZERO credentials — DESIGN.md §3 inv 4). Injected at container start by
# docker-entrypoint.sh.
#
# DEPLOY NOTE: this container is INTERNAL. Expose its port on the VPN/LAN only — never add
# it to the public edge reverse proxy (docs/TODO.md #1).

# Ads API upstream (host:port) that nginx reverse-proxies /admin-api/* to. Cleartext HTTP
# between tiers by design. Resolved lazily so the dashboard still serves if the API is
# momentarily unreachable.
API_UPSTREAM=ads-api:8080

# DNS resolver nginx uses to look up API_UPSTREAM. Default 127.0.0.11 is Docker's embedded
# DNS (correct for the compose deployment). On a bare VM using system DNS, set this to that
# resolver (e.g. 127.0.0.53 for systemd-resolved, or your LAN DNS).
# RESOLVER=127.0.0.11
